@startuml seq-05-staff-login
!include ../_style/rahyaab-uml.iuml
title Staff login with MFA, and password reset (UML sequence diagram)
autonumber
hide footbox
actor Teacher
participant ":Dashboard" as Dash
participant ":API" as Api
database ":PostgreSQL" as Db
participant ":EmailService" as Mail
Teacher -> Dash : email + password
activate Dash
Dash -> Api : POST /auth/staff/login
activate Api
Api -> Db : load staff_user; verify argon2id
alt wrong or locked
  Api --> Dash : 401 "Email or password is not right"
else ok
  Api --> Dash : mfa_challenge_id
  Teacher -> Dash : 6-digit code
  Dash -> Api : POST /auth/staff/mfa
  Api --> Dash : 204 session cookie (SameSite=Strict)
  Dash -> Api : GET /dash/classes/{id}/roster
  Api -> Api : RBAC + tenant + consent filter
  Api -> Db : SELECT roster; INSERT audit_log
  Api --> Dash : roster and flags
end
deactivate Api
== Forgot password ==
Teacher -> Dash : "Forgot password?"
Dash -> Api : POST /auth/staff/password-reset
activate Api
opt account exists
  Api -> Db : INSERT password_reset (hash, 30 min)
  Api -> Mail : single-use link
end
Api --> Dash : 202 (same answer for every email)
deactivate Api
deactivate Dash
@enduml
